{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pulls/14","id":4233313039,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSF2Y5878UzsP","html_url":"https://github.com/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pull/14","diff_url":"https://github.com/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pull/14.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pull/14.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/issues/14","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pulls/14/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pulls/14/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/issues/14/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diondavid1998/StreamScout/statuses/0d7ccf87e56a2a6390c525a4451a9dee8dbe5b3b","number":14,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix catalog layout so the docked tab bar stays bottom-pinned","user":{"login":"Copilot","id":198982749,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOC9w8XQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/1143301?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-swe-agent","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Copilot/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The catalog screen could collapse into a centered layout, causing the new docked tab bar to render mid-screen and leaving discover/search states visually detached from the scrollable content. This change tightens the SwiftUI layout hierarchy so the catalog fills the viewport and state-specific placeholders render inside bounded containers.\n\n- **Catalog root layout**\n  - Ensure `CatalogView` expands to the full available height.\n  - Keep the existing bottom tab bar attached via `.safeAreaInset(edge: .bottom)` to a full-screen container instead of a shrink-wrapped stack.\n\n- **Discover state containers**\n  - Wrap loading and error/empty states in full-height `VStack`s.\n  - Remove bare `Spacer()` siblings emitted from `Group`, which were participating in the parent stack layout and pulling the screen toward vertical center.\n\n- **Search state containers**\n  - Apply the same full-height containment to search loading and empty-result states.\n  - Preserve top-aligned scroll content while keeping placeholder states centered within their own bounds.\n\n- **Net effect**\n  - The tab bar remains bottom-docked.\n  - Discover/search placeholder states no longer reflow the entire screen.\n  - Movie/show cards render within the intended full-screen content region once data is available.\n\n```swift\nZStack {\n    ambientBackdrop\n\n    VStack(spacing: 0) {\n        ...\n        discoverContent\n            .frame(maxWidth: .infinity, maxHeight: .infinity)\n    }\n    .frame(maxWidth: .infinity, maxHeight: .infinity, alignment: .top)\n}\n.frame(maxWidth: .infinity, maxHeight: .infinity)\n.safeAreaInset(edge: .bottom) {\n    dockedTabBar\n}\n```","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-08T05:16:11Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T05:16:25Z","closed_at":"2026-08-08T05:16:25Z","merged_at":"2026-08-08T05:16:25Z","merge_commit_sha":"88b9607c422b3e3b20595db36133fa2bc51364fe","assignee":null,"assignees":[{"login":"diondavid1998","id":125705693,"node_id":"U_kgDOB34d3Q","avatar